	<strings name="main_menu/difficulty_select/randomizer/help_strings">
		<string text="Save keeps this setup under a name.\nLoad chooses one saved before."/>
		<string text="Each squad of enemies that many times as large,&#10;with co-op's extra enemies on top of it."/>
		<string text="On: a squad's actors are taken from the pool."/>
		<string text="On: the marines beside you are swapped too,\nonce out of any vehicle. Off: they stay."/>
		<string text="Which actors a squad may become. Tag Injector:\nthe profile's AI alone."/>
		<string text="The only actor a squad may become."/>
		<string text="The Tag Injector profile's AI of this type alone.\nLeft and right choose another."/>
		<string text="Which grunts."/>
		<string text="Which elites. Zealots are the gold commanders."/>
		<string text="Which jackals."/>
		<string text="Which hunters."/>
		<string text="Which combat forms."/>
		<string text="On: a weapon lying in the level is swapped.\nOne a script names stays."/>
		<string text="Which weapons a pickup may become. A weapon\nthe level lacks comes from another level."/>
		<string text="The only weapon a pickup may become."/>
		<string text="The Tag Injector profile's weapons of this type\nalone. Left and right choose another."/>
		<string text="On: an actor's weapon is swapped for one it\ncan hold; one that can hold none keeps its own."/>
		<string text="Which weapons an actor may be given. An actor\nthat can hold none of them keeps its own."/>
		<string text="Only enemies that can hold it get it; others\nkeep theirs (Go Crazy lends them the hands)."/>
		<string text="The Tag Injector profile's weapons of this type\nalone, for those that can hold them."/>
	</strings>
